// operands only in the text, as tiaconv gives them since s16_stl: a count
// C#12 (BCD in the accumulator, though its parsed value is 12), a status bit
// (A OV), memory-indirect by a tag (MW ["Ptr"])
tag Set Bool %I1.2
tag Cv Word %MW20
tag Flag Bool %Q1.0
tag Ptr DWord %MD30
tag Src Word %MW40
tag Dst Word %MW42
A Set
L c:12
S C 1
L C 1
T Cv
L i:30000
L i:30000
+I
A OV
= Flag
L i:320:DInt
T Ptr
L MW ["Ptr"]
T Dst
